Provenance note:

The implementation in this directory is a clean-room reimplementation. It was
authored from the behavior specification in ``SPEC.md`` and from publicly
available documentation of the BMS and BMSON file formats, the SQLite schema
of beatoraja's ``songdata.db`` (as observed via ``PRAGMA table_info``), and
standard hash algorithms (RFC 1321, FIPS 180-4, IEEE 802.3 CRC-32).

No source code from beatoraja, jbms-parser, or any other GPL'd or
proprietary BMS-player implementation was consulted during the writing of
these files.

Behavior-derived constants (e.g. the ``judge`` percentage table and feature/
content bit assignments) were derived empirically by running SQL queries
against a live ``songdata.db``, which is the user's own data, not upstream
code.
